      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 pb-3 border-b border-slate-200 mt-10">
        七、机场行业专业术语权威中英文速查词典
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-6 not-prose">
        <div class="p-4 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl shadow-2xs">
          <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1">1. BGP（边界网关协议）</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">国内多线接入技术，能自动根据访问用户的运营商（电信/联通/移动）匹配最优入口机房，降低国内首跳延迟。</p>
